			"notes": "Changes:\n- Wool beside a spell dispenser muffles that cast's spell sounds\n- Item Transport binds an inventory and moves stacks into it; Void destroys what does not fit\n- New combat strikes: Split (splits after a hit), Weaken, Glow, Shatter (freezes nearby), Combust (ignites nearby), Judgement (extra damage to glowing targets), Root, and Vampiric Mist\n- Astral Barrier is player-passable glass; a redstone pulse flips a connected group so only mobs can pass\n- Transmute converts blocks through datapack recipes\n- Geode Resonance jumps between budding geodes, growing clusters and harvesting mature ones\n- Gem Forge combines gems, applies spell tomes, and sockets or removes a nova gem on a mace\n- Greater Spell Gem combines two combat gems; the second spell fires shortly after each direct hit\n- Spell gems are infused in the mana infuser from a raw spell gem and the item that used to craft them\n- Spell Enchanting Table shows the animated vanilla enchanting book\n- Vortex pulls loose items\n- Spell gem tooltip improvements\n- Updated combat spell visuals\n- Spell dispenser picks up loose items only while a magnet gem is inserted\n- Level Cost follows the vanilla XP curve, including the levels you would actually lose\n- Piercing projectiles pass through entities\n- Spell dispenser projectiles hit the block directly in front"
		},
